  "description": "SQL Server / Azure SQL dialect for DapperPipeline. Provides SqlServerDialect (Microsoft.Data.SqlClient) with T-SQL parameter scanning, DECLARE @Var TABLE support, and retry on deadlock / timeout / optimistic-lock conflicts.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
